  "steps": [
    "Burger sauce: Whisk the ketchup, Greek yogurt (or mayo) and mustard in a small bowl.",
    "Sweet potato bun burger: Preheat the oven to 400°F and line a sheet pan with parchment. Brush the sweet potato slices with the oil, season with salt and pepper, and roast 25 to 30 min, flipping halfway, until tender and browned.",
    "Sweet potato bun burger: Form the beef into a patty, season with salt and pepper and cook in a skillet over medium-high heat 3 to 4 min per side, until 160°F inside.",
    "Sweet potato bun burger: Stack one sweet potato slice, the lettuce, patty, tomato, onion, pickle and burger sauce, and top with the second slice.",
    "Burger burrito: Season the beef log and cook it in a skillet over medium-high heat, turning, 8 to 10 min, until browned on all sides and 160°F inside.",
    "Burger burrito: Spread the sauce down the middle of the tortilla, lay the beef log on top, add the onion, tomato and pickle, fold in the ends and roll up tight. Sear seam side down in the hot skillet for 1 to 2 min to seal.",
    "Big Mac salad: Brown the beef in a skillet over medium-high heat, breaking it up, 6 to 8 min, until no pink remains. Season with salt and pepper and drain.",
    "Big Mac salad: Toss the iceberg, pickle, tomato, onion and beef in a bowl and drizzle with the burger sauce.",
    "Big Mac chopped egg salad: Brown and season the beef as for the salad and let it cool a few minutes.",
    "Big Mac chopped egg salad: Pile the egg whites, tomato, pickle, onion and lettuce on a cutting board and chop together. Add the beef, ketchup and mayo, chop and mix again, and serve with the chips for scooping.",
    "Cauliflower bun burger: Brush the cauliflower slices with the oil and season with salt and pepper. Cook on a grill or grill pan over medium heat, flipping occasionally, 10 to 15 min, until golden on both sides and fork-tender.",
    "Cauliflower bun burger: Season the patty and cook it in a skillet over medium-high heat 3 to 4 min per side, until 160°F inside.",
    "Cauliflower bun burger: Stack one cauliflower slice, the lettuce, patty, tomato, onion, pickles and burger sauce, and top with the second slice.",
    "Big Mac cucumber salad: Brown and season the beef as for the salad. Slice the cucumber thin into a lidded container, add the beef, tomato, pickle, onion, ketchup and mayo, close the lid and shake to combine."
  ],
